  "text.88b3069854d9": "A carbon-assisted laser facial with little planned downtime. What it does, what it is used for, and what the Hollywood name does and does not promise.",
  "text.8915e0c77d7d": "Our approach",
  "text.89376bc1e7f5": "Anima describes its approach to body treatments as prioritizing balance, comfort, and natural enhancement. EMS muscle toning is offered as a complement to a healthy lifestyle and a regular exercise routine, not a replacement for either.",
  "text.89a7cd862c13": "Do not pause laser hair removal — this is the better window",
  "text.89bb66bf7834": "Anima’s current about page identifies Ali Komeili as an International Medical Graduate who completed his medical education and dermatology residency in Iran, with board certification there in 1998 and more than 27 years of clinical experience since.",
  "text.8a84b505b7e1": "hydradermabrasion",
  "text.8a85a1817ac1": "Ask anything about suitability, comfort, or how many sessions you are likely to need.",
  "text.8af1b3498454": "A different way to think about skin",
  "text.8b8b33802a3d": "She founded Anima Med Spa. Her title is published as Medical Consultant and Founder; the treatments she personally performs are confirmed at consultation.",
  "text.8bf23bd1a9e4": "Medical aesthetics in Etobicoke",
