  "text.8c4d640d382f": "The area, skin history, symptoms, products in use, and suitability are reviewed discreetly before anything is agreed.",
  "text.8cf8bba7da73": "proper hydration",
  "text.8cfd6a1bc8f6": "Sun damage in men: why it accumulates faster",
  "text.8dba3b8f3e10": "A plain-language guide to consultation, preparation, downtime, and maintenance. Your provider will confirm instructions for the treatment you choose.",
  "text.8dea8ac72f1a": "Downtime depends on the treatment. Gentle facials may have little or none, while injectables, microneedling, peels, or laser may involve temporary redness, swelling, tenderness, bruising, or sensitivity. You’ll receive specific guidance before treatment.",
  "text.8dee482fc92c": "Clients maintaining an active lifestyle",
  "text.8f60ed9c26ec": "The skin barrier — the protective outer layer — is also more vulnerable after sun exposure. UV degrades collagen and impairs barrier function, which means skin can be genuinely dehydrated while still looking and feeling oily on the surface. That paradox is one of the most common things clinics see in men through the summer, and it is why the instinct to strip oil away usually makes it worse.",
  "text.8f64cd9ea08a": "Permanent makeup · Hair strokes with soft shading",
  "text.8ffd3c3b4c0a": "Honest scope",
  "text.901d7994f677": "Source image published on Anima’s current Chemical Peels page.",
  "text.904ed460fdfd": "Your goals, comfort, schedule, health history, and tolerance for maintenance all matter. Anima’s role is to help you understand the possibilities and choose an approach that feels considered—not rushed.",
  "text.909cb81127c5": "Book",
  "text.91f427f51d6e": "Injectable treatments · Medically supervised infusion",
  "text.926ae7577bd8": "A gift card can be used toward any treatment — facials, injectables, laser, wellness, or brows and lashes — so the person receiving it picks what actually suits them.",
