  "text.9fa7f139a67a": "It is a sensible window. Sun exposure has not yet peaked, which keeps pigment risk lower, and congestion tends to increase as the weather warms. Starting now means there is room to complete a series before summer rather than treating skin at its most sun-exposed.",
  "text.9fb25f229460": "The process",
  "text.9feceb9333b5": "Membership",
  "text.a02927e39244": "The contact and newsletter forms on this site have no server behind them. When you submit one, your browser opens your own email application with the message pre-filled. Nothing leaves your device until you press send in your email app, and this website never receives or stores a copy.",
