  "text.ae02455f9e45": "A facial is one of the ways skin can be helped to:",
  "text.aeb42cc1c17f": "Bring medication, allergy, and prior treatment details. Ask about anything that could affect bruising or healing.",
  "text.af6d8b867eff": "It is a monthly membership. For $159 per month you receive member pricing on treatments, priority booking during peak hours, 15% off professional skincare products, and the sign-up and birthday-month inclusions listed above.",
