  "text.b6b3d1164a64": "Book now",
  "text.b6e014e180c2": "Across a series, changes accumulate rather than arrive at once — the clinic notes that some clients choose three to six sessions for ongoing oiliness, acne, or pore concerns. How much changes, and how long it holds, depends on skin condition, home care, and what else is in the plan.",
  "text.b71ce458baea": "laser hair removal",
  "text.b755cb248c3c": "dry",
  "text.b7a605fc3673": "Sculptra FAQ.",
  "text.b7ba1014101c": "Ask the clinic to compare member pricing against what you booked in the last twelve months. If the numbers do not favour the plan, they will tell you.",
