  "text.bad57ef7837c": "Instagram",
  "text.bade2c7b4cc9": "The trade-off is honest: a lift enhances what is already there and does not add length or density, and it grows out with the natural lash cycle rather than being topped up. Keep lashes dry and away from steam and oils for the first day, and expect roughly six to eight weeks depending on your own cycle.",
