  "text.da17924067bf": "Skin type is reassessed and settings adjusted at every visit, particularly after a summer of sun. Hair also grows in cycles, so a series takes months regardless of when it starts — which is the practical argument for beginning in September rather than scrambling in May, when everyone else does.",
