  "text.ebc3251fce0d": "Anima Med Spa offers personalized, non-surgical aesthetic care in Etobicoke’s Lakeshore Village, with consultations designed to make your options clear.",
  "text.eca33d6edfb8": "Body image is tied to how you feel physically as much as how you look. Weight fluctuations, hormonal changes, and everyday habits all shape that relationship, and they rarely move in a straight line.",
