  "text.fa7cd3256407": "Nothing is held in the calendar until the clinic confirms it with you. If a business day passes without contact, calling the clinic is the quickest way to follow up.",
  "text.fa8ed0bdabdd": "Plan",
  "text.fafdf1d7cc4a": "Requests are read during opening hours. One sent outside them is picked up on the next working day.",
  "text.fb08da35c3b8": "Aesthetic treatment works best when it supports confidence rather than manufacturing pressure. What that distinction looks like in practice.",
  "text.fb9d3ed2c422": "Laser Tattoo Removal",
  "text.fbac4b3a9973": "Anima's aim is to help people feel comfortable in their own skin — enhancing what is already there rather than changing it. That means treatments grounded in science and safety, explained honestly, with the limits stated as plainly as the benefits.",
  "text.fbccda060e95": "At home",
  "text.fbe43528a9f7": "Call this campaign",
